 "subtitle", "time": 2677.19, "timestamp": "00:44:37", "text": "好的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2680.15, "timestamp": "00:44:40", "text": "兩位顧客。哦，我的小"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2682.55, "timestamp": "00:44:42", "text": "玩意兒裡已經有一個了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2689.51, "timestamp": "00:44:49", "text": "好了，我們走吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2784.15, "timestamp": "00:46:24", "text": "哦，不。不，不，求求你，求求你，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2787.19, "timestamp": "00:46:27", "text": "不，不，不。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2790.15, "timestamp": "00:46:30", "text": "我的直升機。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2803.43, "timestamp": "00:46:43", "text": "。堅持，稍等。我正在接近你的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2804.55, "timestamp": "00:46:44", "text": "位置。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2807.51, "timestamp": "00:46:47", "text": "有人來了。有人來了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2817.349, "timestamp": "00:46:57", "text": "。我們出發吧。我們出發吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2819.829, "timestamp": "00:46:59", "text": "不是祂不會來。我勒個去？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2841.99, "timestamp": "00:47:21", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2858.15, "timestamp": "00:47:38", "text": "尼諾汽車。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2861.99, "timestamp": "00:47:41", "text": "呃，我想要這架10層飛機。它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2882.23, "timestamp": "00:48:02", "text": "好的。沒人會來，兄弟。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2885.109, "timestamp": "00:48:05", "text": "也許這輛卡車會來。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2891.99, "timestamp": "00:48:11", "text": "快點。救救我。給我一張票，我想"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2894.79, "timestamp": "00:48:14", "text": "搭便車回家。返回基地。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2896.069, "timestamp": "00:48:16", "text": "不想"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2898.55, "timestamp": "00:48:18", "text": "重生。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2930.069, "timestamp": "00:48:50", "text": "沒人去。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2931.99, "timestamp": "00:48:51", "text": "我會按下重生鍵。  該死的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2957.51, "timestamp": "00:49:17", "text": "霰彈槍。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2968.79, "timestamp": "00:49:28", "text": "我們盡量快點結束吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2978.549, "timestamp": "00:49:38", "text": "不過我想要一輛悍馬。哼。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3018.47, "timestamp": "00:50:18", "text": "嗯，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3042.069, "timestamp": "00:50:42", "text": "我該如何刪除這個？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3077.91, "timestamp": "00:51:17", "text": "好了，那個球員來了。我只需要一個"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3112.79, "timestamp": "00:51:52", "text": "他不會來了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3115.829, "timestamp": "00:51:55", "text": "看來我只能獨自前往了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3145.03, "timestamp": "00:52:25", "text": "如果我在低海拔地區行駛，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3149.829, "timestamp": "00:52:29", "text": "就能獲得更高的速度，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3152.47, "timestamp": "00:52:32", "text": "正如你所看到的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3217.03, "timestamp": "00:53:37", "text": "誰來救我出去。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3218.79, "timestamp": "00:53:38", "text": "好吧，我想我得去做點"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3290.87, "timestamp": "00:54:50", "text": "哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3331.99, "timestamp": "00:55:31", "text": "千萬別死啊，喬克。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3334.23, "timestamp": "00:55:34", "text": "如果你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3364.309, "timestamp": "00:56:04", "text": "哦，他"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3370.95, "timestamp": "00:56:10", "text": "好像既運送物資又"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3390.549, "timestamp": "00:56:30", "text": "所以綠隊的那個人，應該就在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3394.549, "timestamp": "00:56:34", "text": "這片山區附近。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3403.99, "timestamp": "00:56:43", "text": "那邊那架就是武裝直升機。我能"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3468.309, "timestamp": "00:57:48", "text": "哦，是的。我現在的主要目標是，我想要的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3470.95, "timestamp": "00:57:50", "text": "不僅僅是直升機相關的設備。我確實想要一張"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3499.67, "timestamp": "00:58:19", "text": "啊，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3502.549, "timestamp": "00:58:22", "text": "卡車行駛速度太快了。  卡車行駛速度"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3521.03, "timestamp": "00:58:41", "text": "哇，看看他的技術，兄弟。看看"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3537.75, "timestamp": "00:58:57", "text": "他撞到樹後，竟然像個"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3559.349, "timestamp": "00:59:19", "text": "好吧，我可能只要把"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3568.309, "timestamp": "00:59:28", "text": "這些不是我的嗎？為什麼沒有人存入"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3577.67, "timestamp": "00:59:37", "text": "哦，他們有個叫Sam的人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3588.95, "timestamp": "00:59:48", "text": "應該出去打獵。我不"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3598.95, "timestamp": "00:59:58", "text": "拜託各位。我們去打獵吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3602.87, "timestamp": "01:00:02", "text": "我想殺幾個人。  我要不穿內褲了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3621.349, "timestamp": "01:00:21", "text": "如果我看到任何直升機，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3642.15, "timestamp": "01:00:42", "text": "哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3645.67, "timestamp": "01:00:45", "text": "我看到敵人了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3652.39, "timestamp": "01:00:52", "text": "這是攻擊。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3655.109, "timestamp": "01:00:55", "text": "那是一架武裝直升機。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3658.15, "timestamp": "01:00:58", "text": "那邊那個人就是個球員。  他"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3700.71, "timestamp": "01:01:40", "text": "問題是我有一個3倍鏡。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3703.829, "timestamp": "01:01:43", "text": "哦，等等。這是2倍。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3706.87, "timestamp": "01:01:46", "text": "哦，是的。這是3倍。是的，我的確有一家"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3733.51, "timestamp": "01:02:13", "text": "只要我不被抓到，我就可以……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3735.43, "timestamp": "01:02:15", "text": "那傢伙在狙擊。我聽到他"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3739.27, "timestamp": "01:02:19", "text": "開槍的聲音。我聽到他開槍的聲音。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3741.27, "timestamp": "01:02:21", "text": "我只需要知道他的具體位置。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3744.87, "timestamp": "01:02:24", "text": "它現在應該已經過期了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3747.91, "timestamp": "01:02:27", "text": "哦，我看到他了。我看見他了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3752.63, "timestamp": "01:02:32", "text": "他正在這裡進行狙擊。這邊。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3755.43, "timestamp": "01:02:35", "text": "但是，我該冒這個險嗎？難道沒有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3758.39, "timestamp": "01:02:38", "text": "比他更優秀的人嗎？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3770.87, "timestamp": "01:02:50", "text": "檢查邊角。檢查每一棟建築物。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3779.589, "timestamp": "01:02:59", "text": "即使現在沒有陰影，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3782.39, "timestamp": "01:03:02", "text": "我也應該小心。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3831.99, "timestamp": "01:03:51", "text": "就像一隻手，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3859.99, "timestamp": "01:04:19", "text": "我真希望當時手邊有一把狙擊槍，這樣就能應付"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3862.069, "timestamp": "01:04:22", "text": "這種遠距離作戰了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3869.829, "timestamp": "01:04:29", "text": "如果我有個狙擊手，那就太好了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3917.029, "timestamp": "01:05:17", "text": "附近有一名球員正在進站"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3951.91, "timestamp": "01:05:51", "text": "好像他就在那裡一樣。那玩意兒可能是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3954.39, "timestamp": "01:05:54", "text": "想狙擊什麼的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3964.23, "timestamp": "01:06:04", "text": "沒有把握。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3967.589, "timestamp": "01:06:07", "text": "但我可以。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3978.069, "timestamp": "01:06:18", "text": "等待。那隻助跑器去哪了？它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3980.069, "timestamp": "01:06:20", "text": "來自這裡。  我的天哪"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3985.67, "timestamp": "01:06:25", "text": "。等待。那可能是他們的基地。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3988.95, "timestamp": "01:06:28", "text": "哦，他們現在正從那裡過來。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4017.829, "timestamp": "01:06:57", "text": "我必須小心。我正在滲透"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4020.39, "timestamp": "01:07:00", "text": "。  我們出發吧"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4104.55, "timestamp": "01:08:24", "text": "我覺得這個球員好像能發現"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4125.51, "timestamp": "01:08:45", "text": "試圖與這裡"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4127.189, "timestamp": "01:08:47", "text": "發生的每一件事都進行辯論"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4131.59, "timestamp": "01:08:51", "text": "。他可能在務農，開著"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4149.99, "timestamp": "01:09:09", "text": "如果我有一把銼刀槍，我就可以近距離"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4153.669, "timestamp": "01:09:13", "text": "射擊那架直升機了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4166.789, "timestamp": "01:09:26", "text": "至少我還能透過這種方式間接賺錢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4175.669, "timestamp": "01:09:35", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4177.59, "timestamp": "01:09:37", "text": "我被抓住了。我被抓住了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4182.149, "timestamp": "01:09:42", "text": "我被抓住了。  我被抓住了。我被抓住了。我被抓住了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4212.63, "timestamp": "01:10:12", "text": "那像個無線電塔嗎？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4250.31, "timestamp": "01:10:50", "text": "我聽到有人在說話。剛才來過這裡的那個人去哪裡了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4397.43, "timestamp": "01:13:17", "text": "好事？  發現"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4558.842, "timestamp": "01:15:58", "text": "不能直接"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4593.75, "timestamp": "01:16:33", "text": "突襲他們的基地。  看起來確實是空蕩蕩的。  哦，這裡有兩個人。  他媽的。  拉屎。  拉屎。  請不要這樣對我。請。  [呻吟]求求你們了。  你個混蛋。  我嚇壞了。對不起。對不起。我嚇壞了。我當時就像敵人一樣。  你打不到我們。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4611.83, "timestamp": "01:16:51", "text": "哦，你好。呃，你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4615.43, "timestamp": "01:16:55", "text": "可以，你可以拿武器。我只是想提升偵察等級。我只是去"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4616.79, "timestamp": "01:16:56", "text": "偵察一下，謝謝。  你可以拿走"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 4876.74, "timestamp": "01:21:16", "author": "@BreaDGuy0078", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/O8v1G-sabQKoVvPbSD8h_pLVydQ_mLyNSXpDD2A2gNJXBLHO228IzT5zq41iTuqUdmG_2xiIlg=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "the boys are judging yu"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4939.99, "timestamp": "01:22:19", "text": "為什麼？為什麼？我做錯了什麼才落得如此下場？  為什麼我不在的時候，那些男孩都在評斷你？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4968.31, "timestamp": "01:22:48", "text": "什麼？  我的意思是，我當時……我知道。我知道。我盡量採取穩健的做法。我讓那些敵人沒能殺了我。我嘗試過談判。他們放過了我。但是遊戲崩潰了。我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4979.75, "timestamp": "01:22:59", "text": "電腦運作緩慢。所有功能都運作緩慢。那真是太遺憾了。你知道嗎，我其實有個復仇計畫。  所以，我希望有人提出過這樣的要求。什麼？我因為"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4990.55, "timestamp": "01:23:10", "text": "組隊被封鎖了嗎"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5055.91, "timestamp": "01:24:15", "text": "為什麼它會踢我？我做了什麼？  我無法加入。  到底是怎麼回事"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5087.669, "timestamp": "01:24:47", "text": "？  是的。這很奇怪嗎？  讓我加入吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5092.95, "timestamp": "01:24:52", "text": "至少我還能當飛行員，你知道的。新遊戲。  我光靠雕塑就賺了 4000 美元。  你在買什麼？你得"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5097.91, "timestamp": "01:24:57", "text": "花錢。你就是無法"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5100.229, "timestamp": "01:25:00", "text": "抗拒。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5112.87, "timestamp": "01:25:12", "text": "好的，我會爭取那個試播集。  快點。要賺錢就得先花錢。  好的，偵察兵是八號。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5126.149, "timestamp": "01:25:26", "text": "我必須把它升到10級才能拿到那把好的狙擊步槍。  好了，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5143.35, "timestamp": "01:25:43", "text": "你好。打擾一下。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5146.47, "timestamp": "01:25:46", "text": "第一個之後，我是第一個把直升機弄到這裡的人。那麼"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5150.87, "timestamp": "01:25:50", "text": "，我們走吧。  嗯？  兄弟，那是我的。  什麼？  嗯？那是我的。好吧"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5219.03, "timestamp": "01:26:59", "text": "好吧，我他媽要走了。天哪，會有人來這裡嗎"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5232.31, "timestamp": "01:27:12", "text": "？  不，他們不會。快點。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5247.03, "timestamp": "01:27:27", "text": "進去吧。也許我應該回去。  有個傢伙要來。是的。進來。進來。好的。進來。嗯。是的。  顧客越多，收入越多。  他剛才是怎麼死的？他是不是換隊了？  好的。即使只有一個人。走吧，夥計"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5249.35, "timestamp": "01:27:29", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5251.99, "timestamp": "01:27:31", "text": "哇，這傢伙的派對得分是滿分。  看看他"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5323.35, "timestamp": "01:28:43", "text": "我只有一個伴侶，我很滿足。  我至少應該帶些補給品。  嗨，喬。  哦，這裡有一座塔。好的。  但很遺憾，你不能拿下那座塔。  我的天，太多了。敵方直升機。  好的，我要回去了。當心。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5325.91, "timestamp": "01:28:45", "text": "兄弟，我來了。  你一定可以的。  你一定可以的。  哦，天哪，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5332.31, "timestamp": "01:28:52", "text": "有人降落在……上面。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5341.91, "timestamp": "01:29:01", "text": "如果我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5345.03, "timestamp": "01:29:05", "text": "解鎖了攻擊直升機，我現在早就把"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5348.55, "timestamp": "01:29:08", "text": "他們擊落了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5357.27, "timestamp": "01:29:17", "text": "得到它。  等等，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5367.75, "timestamp": "01:29:27", "text": "運送那個人的錢。他是不是死了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5408.55, "timestamp": "01:30:08", "text": "哦，顧客真多啊。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5414.31, "timestamp": "01:30:14", "text": "顧客真多。  顧客真多。快點。快點。進來。進來。進來。進來。進來。進來。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5417.91, "timestamp": "01:30:17", "text": "一位"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5451.43, "timestamp": "01:30:51", "text": "顧客，兄弟。快點。  去你的。我的天啊。  為什麼要選擇最大的？  請。請。  為什麼選擇挑戰最大的目標？  是的。謝謝。好顧客。總是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5463.51, "timestamp": "01:31:03", "text": "等等，他走了嗎？我勒個去？我勒個去？我勒個去"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5478.229, "timestamp": "01:31:18", "text": "天哪，我太生氣了。就因為我買"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5480.55, "timestamp": "01:31:20", "text": "了些東西，你就得"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5483.59, "timestamp": "01:31:23", "text": "走？離開。你現在是在跟我開玩笑嗎"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5490.95, "timestamp": "01:31:30", "text": "不。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5522.07, "timestamp": "01:32:02", "text": "布羅，過來。趕快說完，免得其他"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5527.75, "timestamp": "01:32:07", "text": "你在說什麼，因為我不懂"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5549.99, "timestamp": "01:32:29", "text": "其他人，其他直升機正在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5552.87, "timestamp": "01:32:32", "text": "返回。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5606.79, "timestamp": "01:33:26", "text": "我必須